itional": "被", "pinyin": "bèi", "translation": "used to indicate passive voice (placed before the doer of the action like \"by\" in English passive-voice sentences, or, if the doer is not mentioned, before the verb) / (sarcastic or jocular) used to indicate that the following word should be regarded as being in air quotes", "hsk": "HSK 3"}, {"word": "发现", "word_simplified": "发现", "word_traditional": "發現", "pinyin": "fā xiàn", "translation": "to notice; to become aware of / to discover; to find; to detect", "hsk": "HSK 3"}, {"word": "了", "word_simplified": "了", "word_traditional": "了", "pinyin": "le", "translation": "(completed action marker) / (modal particle indicating change of state, situation now)", "hsk": "HSK 1"}, {"word": "如果", "word_simplified": "如果", "word_traditional": "如果", "pinyin": "rú guǒ", "translation": "if; in case; in the event that", "hsk": "HSK 3"}, {"word": "时候", "word_simplified": "时候", "word_traditional": "時候", "pinyin": "shí hou", "translation": "time / length of time / moment / period", "hsk": "HSK 1"}, {"word": "自己", "word_simplified": "自己", "word_traditional": "自己", "pinyin": "zì jǐ", "translation": "oneself; (attributive) one's own", "hsk": "HSK 3"}, {"word": "耳朵", "word_simplified": "耳朵", "word_traditional": "耳朵", "pinyin": "ěr duo", "translation": "ear / handle (on a cup)", "hsk": "HSK 3"}, {"word": "捂", "word_simplified": "捂", "word_traditional": "捂", "pinyin": "wǔ", "translation": "to enclose / to cover with the hand (one's eyes, nose or ears) / to cover up (an affair) / to contradict", "hsk": "HSK 7-9"}, {"word": "起来", "word_simplified": "起来", "word_traditional": "起來", "pinyin": "qǐ lái", "translation": "indicating the beginning and continuation of an action or a state / indicating an upward movement / indicating completion / expressing preliminary judgment", "hsk": "HSK 4"}, {"word": "什么", "word_simplified": "什么", "word_traditional": "什麼", "pinyin": "shén me", "translation": "something; anything", "hsk": "HSK 1"}, {"word": "不", "wor